# AI Interview Coach - Optional Free API Keys
# Note: The application operates 100% offline and free by default without any API keys.
# If you wish to use cloud open-source LLMs (Llama 3.3 70B or Gemini Flash), provide keys below:

# Groq Free API Key (Get free key from: https://console.groq.com)
GROQ_API_KEY=

# Google Gemini Free Tier Key (Get free key from: https://aistudio.google.com)
GEMINI_API_KEY=

# Local Ollama Host (default: http://localhost:11434)
OLLAMA_HOST=http://localhost:11434
